#
# Module
#
ModuleEnableBankingName = Enable Banking
ModuleEnableBankingDesc = Synchronise bank accounts with Enable Banking (Open Banking PSD2), match transactions with invoices and reconcile automatically
EnableBanking = Enable Banking
EnableBankingDescription = Synchronise bank accounts with Enable Banking (Open Banking PSD2), match received and sent payments with customer and supplier invoices, and reconcile bank lines.
Permission51745001 = Read bank transactions imported from Enable Banking
Permission51745002 = Connect or disconnect a bank account with Enable Banking
Permission51745003 = Validate matches (create payments, link and reconcile bank lines)
EnableBankingCronSync = Enable Banking: import bank transactions
EnableBankingCronSyncComment = Imports booked transactions of linked accounts and computes match suggestions. Banks allow 4 background fetches per day and per account.

#
# Setup
#
EnableBankingSetup = Enable Banking setup
EnableBankingSetupHelp = Create an application in the Enable Banking control panel (https://enablebanking.com/cp/applications), with the callback URL below, and paste here its id and the private key generated with it.
EnableBankingCallbackUrl = Redirect URL to declare in your Enable Banking application
EnableBankingCallbackUrlHelp = The bank sends the user back to this page after the authorisation. The user must be logged in Dolibarr.
EnableBankingApplicationId = Application ID
EnableBankingApplicationIdHelp = Id of the application (kid), shown in the Enable Banking control panel
EnableBankingPrivateKey = Private key (PEM)
EnableBankingPrivateKeyHelp = RSA private key of the application, used to sign the requests. It is stored encrypted and never displayed again.
EnableBankingPrivateKeyStored = A private key is stored. Paste a new one to replace it.
EnableBankingPaymentMode = Payment mode of created payments
EnableBankingPaymentModeHelp = Used for transfers. Direct debits detected from the bank transaction code use the mode PRE.
EnableBankingMatchDays = Date tolerance (days)
EnableBankingMatchDaysHelp = Gap allowed between the bank date and the date of a line already entered in Dolibarr
EnableBankingInitialDays = History of first synchronisation (days)
EnableBankingInitialDaysHelp = Number of days of transactions imported on the first synchronisation of an account
EnableBankingSureScore = Score of sure matches
EnableBankingSureScoreHelp = A single candidate with at least this score is preselected for mass validation. Reference of invoice in the label = 50, IBAN of third party = 40, name = 25 (15 if partial), amount = 10, line already entered = 60 (+20 same day).
EnableBankingStatementFormat = Statement number when reconciling
EnableBankingStatementFormatHelp = Date format applied to the booking date (%%Y=year, %%m=month, %%d=day). Default %%Y%%m gives one statement per month.
EnableBankingTestConnection = Test the connection
EnableBankingTestOk = Connection OK with the application
EnableBankingTestKo = Connection failed:
EnableBankingWarningCallbackNotRegistered = The redirect URL %s is not declared in the application.
EnableBankingErrorNotConfigured = The module Enable Banking is not configured (application ID and private key).
EnableBankingErrorBadPrivateKey = The private key is not a valid PEM RSA key.
EnableBankingErrorSignature = The request could not be signed with the private key.

